{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/863423-so-what-do-powers-with-rules-regarding-silver-do-when-you-re-immune-to-silver","id":863423,"title":"So what do powers with rules regarding silver do when you're immune to silver?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-10T18:51:32-07:00","id":863423,"title":"So what do powers with rules regarding silver do when you're immune to silver?","content":"Let's say you have either luna's armour, luna's avenger, or marraige of the sun and moon on. Silver becomes just another material. What happens now with abilities where silver is an important factor? Fog on the moor, Silver reprisal, hagvan's healing, Silver claws...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7244-innocent-flower","name":"Innocent Flower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7244_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-10T21:32:57-07:00","id":863476,"title":"","content":"They work normally, because the wording of the Gift and the lessons of spirit remain the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-10T21:37:25-07:00","id":863479,"title":"","content":"I'm not seeing why any of those are particular problems. I guess a few could be interpreted in a few ways, but the effects seem pretty easy to adjudicate by comparing effects against each other. I can't find any where there isn't a direct answer. Like if you're using Marriage of the Sun and Moon, than Hagvan's Healing would suck against gold instead of silver because that's what the first Gift does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T09:49:36-07:00","id":865984,"title":"","content":"Oh a related question, on silver bullets, if a garou takes a silver bullet, does he take an aggravated damage, every round, until its removed, or does it cauterize surrounding flesh on first round...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T10:27:22-07:00","id":866002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/863423-so-what-do-powers-with-rules-regarding-silver-do-when-you-re-immune-to-silver?p=865984#post865984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh a related question, on silver bullets, if a garou takes a silver bullet, does he take an aggravated damage, every round, until its removed, or does it cauterize surrounding flesh on first round...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd go with the latter or a blowout to avoid excessive book-keeping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T12:09:52-07:00","id":866040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/863423-so-what-do-powers-with-rules-regarding-silver-do-when-you-re-immune-to-silver?p=865984#post865984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh a related question, on silver bullets, if a garou takes a silver bullet, does he take an aggravated damage, every round, until its removed, or does it cauterize surrounding flesh on first round...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the latter. Messing with your healing and provoking frenzy is bad enough. Thematically, the response should be &quot;get angry and kill fast, or run like hell&quot;, not &quot;time out, dig out the bullet or die&quot;.<br /> <br /> Automatic ongoing agg damage is no fun, especially when it takes control out of the player's hands at the same time: oh, whoops, I'm in frenzy and my character's going to die in two rounds. wheeeee.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2214-traveller","name":"Traveller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2214_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T16:53:04-07:00","id":866168,"title":"","content":"So. Examples i was thinking of...<br /> <br /> Would silver claws still provide a rage per turn and provide difficulty to non-murder actions, since the silver no longer hurts anymore than any other claw gift would?<br /> <br /> Would you be totaly invincible in fog of the mor, since silver isn't an issue and thus you'd pass through it just as everything else. I find this one to be the biggest problem. The one where luna's blessing doesn't matter at all; you need a weakness. That said, Marriage of sun and moon allows for a weakness, so it'd be a possibility I think. Luna's avenger and fog on the more would cancel eachother out. <br /> <br /> Silver reprisal does silver damage (even to regular people with no vulnerability). Now you're... well, luna's blessing and avenger should block this, because luna's squirting her love into you. However, marraige of sun and moon... You're a regular individual with no weakness or strength against silver, and would thus take it normaly, i think.<br /> <br /> Hagvan's healing... I think that's another questionable one, because it's not exactly a broken level five gift if you get rid of the silver clause. You can kill someone using the power without silver if you work the power out. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7244-innocent-flower","name":"Innocent Flower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7244_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}